== Effects ==
* Doubles Isaac's {{e|Key|text=keys}}.
* If Isaac has no keys, gives 2 keys instead.

== Strategy ==
* The key counter cannot exceed 99, so the most optimal time to use '''2 of Spades''' is when Isaac has 49 or 50 keys.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: Quadruples Isaac's keys.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: No effect.

